  "2026-07-25T00:14:08.722Z",codex-root,"Research baseline on 2026-07-25: official stable release remains v4.1.2 and branch 4.x remains at the bundled commit; the bundled reference is current at research time."
  "2026-07-25T00:19:14.191Z",codex-root,"PM tooling milestone: global pm-cli is current at 2026.7.24-3; managed and repository pm-changelog are upgraded to 2026.7.24. Project package doctor exposed first-party calendar/guide-shell global output service warnings; after exact and keyword duplicate searches, filed unbraind/pm-cli#687 rather than suppressing the diagnostic."
  "2026-07-25T00:26:28.329Z",codex-root,"Implementation milestone: source-status now emits schema-backed current/stale/unavailable results, supports separate stale and unavailable CI gates, is present in actual CLI/help/schema/e2e surfaces, and latest pm-changelog 2026.7.24 is installed. Focused gates and 853-test coverage pass at exact 100/100/100/100 with 587/587 documented exports."
  "2026-07-25T00:51:00.684Z",codex-root,"Release gate remediation: GitHub reviewed GHSA-mh99-v99m-4gvg affects brace-expansion through 5.0.7 and is fixed in 5.0.8. Raised the existing root override to 5.0.8; bun why confirms the fixed graph and bun audit reports zero vulnerabilities. This is third-party advisory drift, not a pm-cli defect."
  "2026-07-25T00:53:50.749Z",codex-root,"Final tracker acceptance: PM-linked verify:release passes after brace-expansion 5.0.8 remediation; 853 tests are exact 100/100/100/100, 587/587 exports documented, 274/274 help leaves pass, npx and bunx packed version 2026.7.25 pass, bun audit is clean, and history/version scans are clean."
  "2026-07-25T00:55:04.267Z",codex-root,"Post-close self-review finding: the new public GitHub lookup needed to honor the inherited --request-timeout-ms contract. Added the shared abort controller, explicit timeout classification, tests, and docs before PR publication."
  "2026-07-25T00:56:00.170Z",codex-root,"Timeout-hardened acceptance: 854 tests pass at exact 100/100/100/100, 587/587 exports remain documented, source quality and lint pass, and the real CLI verifies the current upstream commit with an explicit 5-second inherited timeout."
notes[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T00:14:08.722Z",codex-root,"Privacy boundary: upstream freshness uses only public GitHub repository metadata. Local Monica credentials and CRM response data are explicitly excluded from tracker evidence."
  "2026-07-25T00:19:16.387Z",codex-root,"Compatibility constraint remains explicit: npm latest for @unbrained/pm-cli is prerelease 2026.7.24-3, which does not satisfy pm-changelog's stable >=2026.7.24 peer range under npm semver. Keep the project dev dependency at stable 2026.7.24 while using the latest global CLI; upstream dist-tag issue remains tracked as #681."
  "2026-07-25T00:53:52.162Z",codex-root,"Live instance result remains an infrastructure classification, not an API parity failure: 44 commands pass, 53 expected Cloudflare trust-proxy bootstrap failures, zero unexpected failures, and five remote mutations are blocked locally. No CRM records were changed."
learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T00:14:08.722Z",codex-root,"Complete endpoint mapping and current endpoint mapping are different claims; agents need an executable freshness proof, not a manually asserted timestamp."
  "2026-07-25T00:53:53.300Z",codex-root,"Freshness gates must distinguish proven drift from inability to verify: only a successful authoritative lookup with a different commit establishes stale state; transport or response failures remain unavailable."
