close_reason: "API source freshness verification, timeout safety, and release evidence are complete"
body: "## Context\nThe CLI maps the full stable Monica 4.x API, but freshness is currently established manually outside the product. Agents can inspect the bundled commit but cannot ask the CLI to verify whether that commit is still the current upstream 4.x head.\n\n## Delivery\n- Add an `api-research source-status` command backed by the official GitHub repository and branch metadata.\n- Compare bundled repository, branch, commit, and route file provenance with the live upstream head without calling or mutating Monica CRM data.\n- Emit deterministic, schema-validated TOON/JSON/YAML/table/Markdown output and offer a CI freshness gate.\n- Keep network failures distinct from stale sources and return actionable agent commands.\n- Update help, agent contracts, docs, package tooling, and read-only end-to-end coverage.\n\n## Safety\nNo CRM endpoint or private payload is involved. The command reads only the public GitHub API and bundled reference metadata. Credentials, host data, and raw live CRM responses remain outside Git and PM."
